  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[7 ÷ 14 × 8 + (5 ÷ 15 × 6 - 4 × 3)]\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[7 ÷ 14 × 8 + (5 ÷ 15 × 6 - 4 × 3)]\n\n⇒ [7 ÷ 14 × 8 + (5/15 × 6 - 4 × 3)]\n\n⇒ [7 ÷ 14 × 8 + (1/3 × 6 - 4 × 3)]\n\n⇒ [7 ÷ 14 × 8 + (2 - 4 × 3)]\n\n⇒ [7 ÷ 14 × 8 + (2 - 12)]\n\n⇒ [7 ÷ 14 × 8 - 10]\n\n⇒ [7/14 × 8 - 10]\n\n⇒ [1/2 × 8 - 10]\n\n⇒ [4 - 10]\n\n⇒ - 6 \n\n**∴ The required answer is - 6.**",
